॰ ॥ RUNG 73 — THE ASSEMBLER, NATIVELY, ON TEXT THE COMPILER JUST EMITTED ॥
॰ (2026-09-14) Every rung before this one stops at TEXT: `स्वपरीक्षा` answers
॰ the emitted octet count and the ladder never calls `पाठवस्तुरचना`, so the
॰ only thing that has ever assembled is the driver, interpreted. That is why
॰ the assembler's own clauses have had to be found through scratch probes.
॰ The store landed (`समावेशसारणी`) and `सङ्कलनारम्भः` fills it, so a compiled
॰ assembler now has its mnemonic and encoding tables for the first time —
॰ this rung is what asks whether it can use them.
॰ THE SOURCE IS THE ENTRY RUNG'S, and the first attempt at a better one is the
॰ reason. A routine ends with `इति` — which is exactly the token that CLOSES a
॰ `उक्तम् … इति` literal — so a module written with `आदि … इति` inside the
॰ literal is truncated mid-routine, and the rung answered १००१, `वाक्यभेद`,
॰ "parsed to no statements". The self-hosting lexer quoting its own magic word,
॰ again. Embedding a real routine needs the line-piece split that
॰ `native-compile.py` performs (`इति` -> `…इ` + `ति…`, rejoined), which belongs
॰ in a generator and not in a hand-written rung.
॰ So the module is one global, its object's `.text` is EMPTY, and the two
॰ answers are OFFSET instead: २००० plus the `.text` length when an object was
॰ built, १००० plus the exit kind when it was not. A bare ० could not be told
॰ from a refusal, which is the mistake the offset exists to prevent.
॰ ॥ RUNG 79 — THE TWO LAYOUTS THEMSELVES, NOT A VERDICT ABOUT THEM ॥ (2026-09-14)
॰ This rung is rung 73 with the dump switched on. Its RETURN is still rung 73's,
॰ deliberately — `१०००+exit` or `२०००+length` — so it remains comparable to rung
॰ 73 element for element, and so a reader can tell "the dump changed the run"
॰ from "the dump reported a difference". The bytes are the payload; the status is
॰ the control.
॰
॰ ══ BOTH HALVES OF THIS MARGIN WERE REFUTED, AND IT WAS READ AS CURRENT FOR
॰ THREE DAYS AFTER ══ (2026-09-18.) It read: *"Rung 73 on the same exemplar
॰ answers `१००३` natively — E22, the two layout passes disagreeing … If this
॰ answers anything other than १००३ natively, the instrument perturbed what it
॰ measures."* Both sentences are now wrong, and because this is the file a reader
॰ opens first, the ledger's own `Next:` repeated them on 2026-09-17 and would have
॰ sent an unattended cycle to bisect a layout pass that never disagreed.
॰
॰ E22 NEVER FIRED. `3af6b6e1` (2026-09-14) measured the two arrays through this
॰ very dump and found them byte-identical with `विन्याससाम्यम्` answering सत्यम्;
॰ the refusal was `उत्सर्जनक्रमः`, one routine further down. `82be3d5d` (2026-09-15)
॰ then found the cause: `पाठवस्तुरचना` bound `वस्तुसङ्केतनम्`'s result as a plain
॰ run and re-derived "refused" from `यदि अष्टकाः समम् शून्यम्` — and natively an
॰ EMPTY run and the nil word are one word, so this data-only exemplar was reported
॰ as "encoding refused" for a compile that refused nothing.
॰
॰ THE NUMBER IT ANSWERS NOW, measured natively on `379d48e1` under `yantra-run`
॰ with `YANTRA_STEPS=200000000000`, which is the reading `82be3d5d`'s own falsifier
॰ section named as the one thing it could not supply:
॰
॰   rung 73 (dump off)   status 2000 · 0 UART octets
॰   rung 79 (dump on)    status 2000 · 232 UART octets
॰
॰ `२०००` is `२००० + ०` — the empty `.text` of a module with no instructions,
॰ reported as the SUCCESS it always was. The status is unmoved by the dump, so the
॰ instrument did not perturb the run, and the 232 octets decode to `pass 1 [0]`,
॰ `pass 2 [0]`, `विन्याससाम्यम् [1]` — **byte for byte the interpreted sink**. The
॰ verdict `82be3d5d` introduced is graded interpreted by
॰ `crates/sadhana-t1/tests/t1_encode_verdict.rs`; it had no test until then.
॰
॰ THE SWITCH GOES AFTER `सङ्कलनारम्भः`, which clears `सङ्केतन`'s module state and
॰ would clear the flag with it — measured, not assumed: set ahead of the reset
॰ the sink comes back empty, which reads exactly like a dump site never reached.
सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः स्वपरीक्षैकोनाशीतिः ददाति न६४ आदि
    चरः आरम्भः ॱॱ न६४ भवति सङ्कलनारम्भः ।
    चरः मूल ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ भवति उक्तम् मण्डलम् क ॥ सार्वजनिक चरः ख ॱॱ न६४ भवति ७ । इति ।
    चरः पाठ्यम् ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ भवति मण्डलसङ्कलनम् आरभ्य मूल ऽ उक्तम् क इति समाप्तम् ।
    चरः स्विचः ॱॱ न६४ भवति सङ्केतनॱविन्यासमुद्रणारम्भः सत्यम् ।
    चरः फलम् ॱॱ सम्भाव्य वास्तुॱवस्तु भवति पाठवस्तुरचना पाठ्यम् ।
    यदि फलम् समम् शून्यम् आदि
        प्रत्यागमनम् १००० योगः वस्तुरचनाविरामभेद ।
    इति
    चरः वस्तूनि ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः वास्तुॱवस्तु भवति ० ।
    वस्तूनि अङ्कः ० अन्तः भवति फलम् ।
    चरः वस्तु ॱॱ वास्तुॱवस्तु भवति वस्तूनि अङ्कः ० अन्तः ।
    प्रत्यागमनम् २००० योगः वस्तु ॱ पाठ्यम् ॱ दैर्घ्य ।
इति

सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः स्वपरीक्षात्रिसप्ततिः ददाति न६४ आदि
    चरः आरम्भः ॱॱ न६४ भवति सङ्कलनारम्भः ।
    चरः मूल ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ भवति उक्तम् मण्डलम् क ॥ सार्वजनिक चरः ख ॱॱ न६४ भवति ७ । इति ।
    चरः पाठ्यम् ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ भवति मण्डलसङ्कलनम् आरभ्य मूल ऽ उक्तम् क इति समाप्तम् ।
    चरः फलम् ॱॱ सम्भाव्य वास्तुॱवस्तु भवति पाठवस्तुरचना पाठ्यम् ।
    यदि फलम् समम् शून्यम् आदि
        ॰ Not a length: the assembler refused, and `वस्तुरचनाविराम` names which
        ॰ exit it took — ० सिद्ध, १ वाक्य (no statements), २ रिक्त (statements but
        ॰ nothing built), ३ अष्टक (encoding refused), ४ विराम. Offset by १००० so a
        ॰ refusal can never be read as a `.text` length.
        प्रत्यागमनम् १००० योगः वस्तुरचनाविरामभेद ।
    इति
    चरः वस्तूनि ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः वास्तुॱवस्तु भवति ० ।
    वस्तूनि अङ्कः ० अन्तः भवति फलम् ।
    चरः वस्तु ॱॱ वास्तुॱवस्तु भवति वस्तूनि अङ्कः ० अन्तः ।
    प्रत्यागमनम् २००० योगः वस्तु ॱ पाठ्यम् ॱ दैर्घ्य ।
इति

