॰ ॥ RUNG 84 — THE ENCODER'S OWN TRACE, NATIVELY ॥ (2026-09-18)
॰ Rung 83 answered `अबसदइ` and faulted: parse, program construction and ADDRESS
॰ LAYOUT all succeed natively, and `सङ्केतनॱवस्तुसङ्केतनम्` — turning
॰ instructions into octets — is the stage that dies.
