॰ THIS ADDS NO MARKERS OF MY OWN. `लक्ष्यवस्तुसङ्केतनम्` already emits a trace
॰ through `चतुरष्टकमुद्रणम्` when `विन्यासमुद्रणार्हम्` is set — tagged records,
॰ four octets each, written as they happen. Rung 79 knows how to switch it on.
॰ So the encoder reports on ITSELF, at its own chosen granularity, and the native
॰ stream is a PREFIX of the interpreted one: the first record that is missing
॰ names where it died, and the last record present names how far it got.
