॰ USING THE FILE'S OWN INSTRUMENT RATHER THAN SPRINKLING MY OWN also avoids the
॰ trap rung 82's margin names — a marker I place between two calls can only see
॰ the calls I already know about, while the encoder's trace was written by
॰ someone who knew where its stages are.
