॰ ══ RUNG 99: A LOOP — `यावत्` with an accumulator, natively ══════════
॰
॰ Rung 97 lowered a CALL and rung 98 a BRANCH. This is the third construct on
॰ the ladder `7319bd11` measured, and it is the ONLY one of the six that tests
॰ control flow with NO CALL IN IT AT ALL: `spec/demo/योगपर्यन्तम्.t1` is one
॰ routine, FIVE blocks, 16 IR instructions, ZERO calls, 29 machine instructions.
॰ The source below is that program with its names shortened; `tools/demo.sh`
॰ over it reports the same 1/5/16/0/29 and the machine halts with status ५५,
॰ which is what १ + २ + … + १० is.
॰
॰ WHY A LOOP IS NOT A BRANCH ALREADY PROVEN. Rung 98's `यदि` has both arms
॰ RETURN, so every block it makes is an exit; nothing joins and nothing flows
॰ backwards. The five blocks here are entry, the test, the body, the join and
॰ the exit, and the body branches BACK to the test — the first BACKWARD edge
॰ any rung of this ladder has asked the compiled emitter to place. The emitted
॰ T0 says so in one line: `लङ्घनम् शून्यःम् कघपर्व१य् ।` at the foot of पर्व२,
॰ a jump to a label the object has ALREADY passed.
॰
॰ THREE PIECES, because this module has TWO bare `इति` — one closing the
॰ `यावत्` and one closing the routine — where rung 98 had three and rung 97
॰ two. Each is split `इ` + `ति` so no piece terminates the literal early, and
॰ `पाठसंयोगः` joins two at a time, so two joins. `भवति` inside a piece does NOT
॰ terminate it: the literal ends at the WORD `इति`, which is why `स्वपरीक्षा`
॰ at the foot of this file can carry `भवति ७` inside one.
॰
॰ IT ANSWERS ६००० PLUS THE OBJECT'S LENGTH, a prefix no other rung uses —
॰ २०००, ३०००, ४००० and ५००० are taken. An empty object answers exactly ६०००
॰ and cannot be read as rung 97's ३११६ or rung 98's ४१६४.
॰
॰ PREDICTED BEFORE THE IMAGE EXISTS, and the falsifiers with it: ६११६, since
॰ 29 instructions are 116 octets. ६००० alone means the object came back empty.
॰ Anything strictly between ६००० and ६११६ should be IMPOSSIBLE — the encoder
॰ returns `शून्यम्` on refusal and the object is all or nothing — so such a
॰ status would overturn that reading and not this rung. A status above ६११६
॰ means the compiled emitter placed MORE than the Rust chain did, which for a
॰ backward edge would mean a relaxation that did not converge.
सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः स्वपरीक्षानवनवतिः ददाति न६४ आदि
    चरः आरम्भः ॱॱ न६४ भवति सङ्कलनारम्भः ।
    चरः चिह्नैक ॱॱ न६४ भवति अष्टकॱमुद्रणम् ६५ ।
    चरः प१ ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ भवति उक्तम् मण्डलम् क ॥ सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः घ ददाति न६४ आदि चरः स ॱॱ न६४ भवति ० । चरः र ॱॱ न६४ भवति १ । यावत् र न्यूनम् ११ आदि स भवति स योगः र । र भवति र योगः १ । इ इति ।
    चरः प२ ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ भवति उक्तम् ति प्रत्यागमनम् स । इ इति ।
    चरः प३ ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ भवति उक्तम् ति इति ।
    चरः युग्मम् ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ भवति पाठसंयोगः आरभ्य प१ ऽ प२ समाप्तम् ।
    चरः मूल ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ भवति पाठसंयोगः आरभ्य युग्मम् ऽ प३ समाप्तम् ।
