॰ ══ RUNG 97: TWO ROUTINES AND A CALL, natively ══════════════════════
॰
॰ Rung 84 compiles ONE routine whose body is a constant, and `tools/demo.sh`
॰ prices it at 1 IR instruction and ZERO calls — the other nine machine
॰ instructions it assembles to are prologue, epilogue and the return path.
॰ Every rung above it tests a mechanism rather than a bigger compile, so a
॰ CALL has never been lowered by the compiled compiler.
॰
॰ This embeds the shape of `spec/demo/द्विगुणम्.t1`, measured through the Rust
॰ chain as 2 routines, 4 blocks, 7 IR instructions, 1 call, 29 machine
॰ instructions, twins agreeing. The source is carried as THREE pieces because
॰ the literal ends at a bare `इति` and this module has two of them; each is
॰ split `इ` + `ति` so no piece terminates early.
॰
॰ IT ANSWERS ३००० PLUS THE OBJECT'S LENGTH, not २०००, so a reader cannot
॰ confuse its status with rung 84's — and an EMPTY object answers exactly ३०००,
॰ which is the shape that named the E02 refusal.
