        ॰ and its `मध्यरूप` shape, four octets each. Nothing else is traced. (The stage is
        ॰ the status already; naming `प्रतिबिम्बविरामः` here, above its declaration, would
        ॰ be one more forward reference for the hoisting ratchet.)
